# Definition of Done

A feature is **not done** until applicable items are complete. Mark N/A with a one-line reason. Tests: [testing.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/testing.mdc).

- **Checklist**
  - [ ] Implementation in canonical folders (`apps/`, `packages/`, `docs/`)
  - [ ] `docs/renverse/` updated when suite membership, events, RBAC, or tenancy changed
  - [ ] `renverse.manifest.json` stays aligned (`suiteRole: addon`, produces/consumes/issa)
  - [ ] **Optional-addon policy intact:** entitlement is `hasAddon('smartload')`, never `hasApp`; Suite SKU must work without SmartLoad
  - [ ] SoR bans: no full WMS/ERP; Tally remains on-prem unless explicitly designed
  - [ ] Auth: dual-mode + addon entitlement + local `can` + `in_scope` on server
  - [ ] **EP-SL-01 tenancy blocker** respected — do not claim suite GA without org model
  - [ ] Unit / integration / API tests for changed behavior
  - [ ] Addon deny (403 `ADDON_NOT_ENABLED`) tested when entitlement surfaces change
  - [ ] `docs/CODEBASE_GRAPH.md` updated if structure or suite bridge changed
  - [ ] Lint/typecheck for touched packages; hooks not skipped

- **End of every implementation task, output:**

```
# Change Summary
## Feature/Change Implemented
- Name:
- Files changed:
## Contracts / Docs
| Artifact | Update Summary |
## Tests Added/Updated
| Test Type | File Path | Scenarios Covered |
## Commands Run
| Command | Result |
## Definition of Done Status
- Complete / Incomplete
- If incomplete, list remaining items.
```

No tests for a behavior change = not done. Structural change without graph update = not done. Weakening addon-optional policy = not done.
